{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an fun journey into the world of coding with SirKwitz 2, the sequel to the beloved educational game that demystifies the fundamentals of coding. <br>This beginner-friendly game is a perfect entry point for kids, youth and adults new to coding, offering a hands-on approach to learning the basics through a series of engaging puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Especially tailored for those who think &quot;programming&quot; is a scary word</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple yet engaging puzzles, teaching core programming concepts like instructions, functions, loops and Booleans.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean &amp; intuitive user interface for easy steps-tracking</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546820?t=1765566322","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3546820?t=1765566322","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546820/259bd1e37864103d0471666617168cf7dd102575/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765566322","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3546820/259bd1e37864103d0471666617168cf7dd102575/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765566322","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an fun journey into the world of coding with SirKwitz 2, the sequel to the beloved educational game that demystifies the fundamentals of coding. <br>This beginner-friendly game is a perfect entry point for kids, youth and adults new to coding, offering a hands-on approach to learning the basics through a series of engaging puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"b